Package: code-version-manager
Version: 0.1.2
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: linxb <linxb@gzsendi.cn>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, git
Recommends: bcompare
Description: Local graphical workspace version manager
 A GTK desktop application for initializing version management in any folder,
 selecting packaged files, comparing complete snapshots with Beyond Compare,
 downloading historical versions, and viewing generated RST changelogs.
